      "problem_text": "If log_2 x = a and log_3 x = b, find log_6 x in terms of a and b.",
      "answer": "ab/(a+b)",
      "solution": "log_6 x = 1/log_x 6 = 1/(log_x 2 + log_x 3) = 1/(1/a + 1/b) = 1/((b+a)/ab) = ab/(a+b)",
